'''Sakura Miku''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 9.4 Update|Version 9.4]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 536
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Sakura Miku
|name2 = Sakura Miku CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Sakura Miku CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Sakura Miku can provide proper support in Alien stages due to her high standing range with far piercing and inner range combined with [[Freeze]] ability. Due to the low uptime of her freeze, Sakura Miku's role is to reduce pressure at the backlines, rather than to perma-freeze. Her barrier breaking chance is rather low, so it should not be relied upon.

Sakura Miku can also be a decent generalist sniper, as her damage and DPS are not bad for her range and her survivability is great thanks to her good knockback count.

{{Job|Classification = Sniper & Crowd-Controller}}

